{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05666","headline":"故右丞相赠太师燕文贞公挽词二首 一 · 孙逖","name":"故右丞相赠太师燕文贞公挽词二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海内文章伯，朝端礼乐英。\n一言兴宝运，三入济羣生。\n命与才相偶，年将位不幷。\n台星忽已坼，流恸轸皇情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}